VALUES ('c-1788097425590', 'School', 'SD', 'Matematika', 'Kelas 4', 'PENGARUH ASAM BASA', 'ASAM BASA', '{"id":"c-1788097425590","babs":[{"id":"bab_1788097478101","title":"ASAM","subBabs":[{"id":"sub_1788097484741","type":"video","title":"APA ITU ASAM?","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"<p>Ketik materi di sini...</p>\n","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HyhLsy6b0XI&list=RDz2D3fwImlRk&index=4","questions":[{"id":"q_1788098528044","text":"AWDADWA","type":"pg","pairs":[{"left":"","right":""}],"points":10,"options":["ADWA","ADWA","ADWA","ADWA"],"statements":[{"text":"","isCorrect":"true"}],"correctAnswers":"2","videoTimestamp":"10","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":[]}],"materiFormat":"ckeditor","videoDuration":321,"videoDurationFormatted":"5 menit 21 detik"},{"id":"sub_1788098570275","type":"materi","title":"PDF","pdfUrl":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1a4-QZzTpn_SkY5a1YjeTxkrSKej-pNz7/view?usp=drive_link","rawHtml":"<p>Ketik materi di sini...</p>\n","videoUrl":"","questions":[],"materiFormat":"pdf"},{"id":"sub_1788099180403","type":"materi","title":"Sub Bab Baru","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"<p>Eksponen (perpangkatan) adalah operasi matematika yang menyatakan perkalian berulang dari suatu bilangan dengan dirinya sendiri sebanyak pangkat yang ditentukan.</p>\n\n<p>Bentuk umum eksponen:</p>\n\n<p>$$a^n = \\underbrace{a \\times a \\times \\dots \\times a}_{n \\text{ kali}}$$</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>$a$ = bilangan pokok (basis), dengan $a \\in \\mathbb{R}$</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>$n$ = pangkat (eksponen), dengan $n$ bilangan bulat positif</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Sifat-Sifat Operasi Eksponen</strong></p>\n\n<p>Untuk $a, b \\in \\mathbb{R}$ dan $m, n$ bilangan bulat (dengan syarat basis tidak nol untuk pembagian/pangkat negatif):</p>\n\n<table>\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>No.</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Sifat</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Rumus</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Contoh Soal</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Perkalian basis sama</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$a^m \\times a^n = a^{m+n}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$2^3 \\times 2^4 = 2^{3+4} = 2^7 = 128$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>2</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pembagian basis sama</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$\\frac{a^m}{a^n} = a^{m-n}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$\\frac{5^6}{5^2} = 5^{6-2} = 5^4 = 625$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>3</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pangkat dipangkatkan</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$(a^m)^n = a^{m \\times n}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$(3^2)^3 = 3^{2 \\times 3} = 3^6 = 729$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>4</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Perkalian dipangkatkan</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$(a \\times b)^n = a^n \\times b^n$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$(2 \\times 3)^2 = 2^2 \\times 3^2 = 4 \\times 9 = 36$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>5</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pembagian dipangkatkan</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)^n = \\frac{a^n}{b^n}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^3 = \\frac{2^3}{3^3} = \\frac{8}{27}$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>6</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pangkat nol ($a \\neq 0$)</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$a^0 = 1$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$7^0 = 1$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>7</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pangkat negatif ($a \\neq 0$)</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$a^{-n} = \\frac{1}{a^n}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$4^{-2} = \\frac{1}{4^2} = \\frac{1}{16}$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>8</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pangkat pecahan (akar)</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$a^{\\frac{m}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a^m}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$8^{\\frac{2}{3}} = \\sqrt[3]{8^2} = \\sqrt[3]{64} = 4$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><strong>Persamaan Eksponen Dasar</strong></p>\n\n<p>Bentuk persamaan aljabar yang memuat variabel pada bagian pangkat:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Jika $a^{f(x)} = a^p$, maka $f(x) = p$</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<p><em>Contoh:</em> $2^{2x - 1} = 32 \\implies 2^{2x - 1} = 2^5 \\implies 2x - 1 = 5 \\implies x = 3$</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Jika $a^{f(x)} = a^{g(x)}$, maka $f(x) = g(x)$</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<p><em>Contoh:</em> $3^{x^2 - 3x} = 3^{x - 3} \\implies x^2 - 3x = x - 3 \\implies x^2 - 4x + 3 = 0 \\implies x = 1 \\text{ atau } x = 3$</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Jika $a^{f(x)} = b^{f(x)}$ dengan $a \\neq b$, maka $f(x) = 0$</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<p><em>Contoh:</em> $5^{2x - 4} = 7^{2x - 4} \\implies 2x - 4 = 0 \\implies x = 2$</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Pertidaksamaan Eksponen</strong></p>\n\n<p>Untuk menyelesaikan $a^{f(x)} &gt; a^{g(x)}$ atau $a^{f(x)} &lt; a^{g(x)}$, perhatikan nilai basis $a$:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Basis $a &gt; 1$ (Tanda ketidaksamaan TETAP):</strong></p>\n\n\t<p>$$a^{f(x)} &gt; a^{g(x)} \\implies f(x) &gt; g(x)$$</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Basis $0 &lt; a &lt; 1$ (Tanda ketidaksamaan DIBALIK):</strong></p>\n\n\t<p>$$a^{f(x)} &gt; a^{g(x)} \\implies f(x) &lt; g(x)$$</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em>Contoh:</em></p>\n\n<p>$$\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2x + 1} \\le \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^5 \\implies 2x + 1 \\ge 5 \\implies 2x \\ge 4 \\implies x \\ge 2$$</p>\n\n<p><strong>Contoh Soal Penyederhanaan</strong></p>\n\n<p>Sederhanakan bentuk:</p>\n\n<p>$$\\frac{(x^2 y^{-3})^2}{x^{-1} y^2}$$</p>\n\n<p><em>Penyelesaian:</em></p>\n\n<ol start=\"1\">\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Terapkan sifat pangkat dipangkatkan pada pembilang:</p>\n\n\t<p>$$(x^2 y^{-3})^2 = x^{2 \\times 2} y^{-3 \\times 2} = x^4 y^{-6}$$</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Gabungkan dengan penyebut menggunakan sifat pembagian basis sama:</p>\n\n\t<p>$$\\frac{x^4 y^{-6}}{x^{-1} y^2} = x^{4 - (-1)} \\cdot y^{-6 - 2} = x^5 y^{-8} = \\frac{x^5}{y^8}$$</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n","videoUrl":"","questions":[],"materiFormat":"ckeditor"},{"id":"sub_1788099279737","type":"kuis","title":"astrokuy","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"","videoUrl":"","questions":[{"id":"q_1788342927205_1","text":"<p>Sebuah bintang biner visual memiliki periode orbit 50 tahun dan paralaks trigonometri 0,05 detik busur. Dari pengamatan orbit relatif, diketahui sumbu semi-mayor terpisahkan sebesar 1,25 detik busur di langit. Berapakah massa total sistem bintang biner tersebut dalam satuan massa Matahari (M_sun)?</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["2,5 M_sun","6,25 M_sun","12,5 M_sun","25,0 M_sun","31,25 M_sun"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Jarak d = 1 / p = 1 / 0,05 = 20 pc. Separasi semi-mayor a = alpha x d = 1,25 x 20 = 25 AU. Hukum III Kepler: (M1 + M2) = a^3 / P^2 = 25^3 / 50^2 = 15.625 / 2.500 = 6,25 M_sun.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"1","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927206_2","text":"<p>Dua buah bintang A dan B memiliki magnitudo semu visual yang sama. Jika bintang A bertipe spektrum B (T_eff = 12.000 K) berada pada jarak 200 pc, sedangkan bintang B bertipe spektrum G (T_eff = 6.000 K) berada pada jarak 50 pc, berapakah perbandingan radius bintang A terhadap bintang B (R_A / R_B)?</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["1 : 1","1 : 2","1 : 4","2 : 1","4 : 1"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Magnitudo semu sama menandakan fluks yang diterima sama (F_A = F_B). Karena F sebanding dengan (R^2 x T^4) / d^2, maka (R_A / R_B) = (d_A / d_B) x (T_B / T_A)^2 = (200 / 50) x (6.000 / 12.000)^2 = 4 x (1/2)^2 = 1.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"0","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927206_3","text":"<p>Di suatu lokasi dengan lintang geografis 30° LS, sebuah bintang teramati mengalami kulminasi atas tepat di titik Zenit pengamat. Ketinggian bintang tersebut saat mengalami kulminasi bawah adalah...</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["30° di atas ufuk Selatan","60° di atas ufuk Selatan","Tepat di horizon (0°)","Di bawah horizon (tidak teramati)","60° di atas ufuk Utara"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Karena kulminasi atas tepat di Zenit pada lintang phi = -30°, deklinasi bintang delta = -30°. Batas bintang sirkumpolar selatan adalah delta &lt;= -(90° - |phi|) = -60°. Bintang dengan delta = -30° bukan sirkumpolar, sehingga saat kulminasi bawah posisinya berada di bawah horizon (h = -90°).</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"3","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927206_4","text":"<p>Sebuah galaksi spiral teramati memiliki pergeseran merah garis spektrum sebesar z = 0,02. Menggunakan konstanta Hubble H0 = 70 km/s/Mpc dan kecepatan cahaya c = 300.000 km/s, modulus jarak (m - M) galaksi tersebut adalah...</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["31,52","33,18","34,67","36,45","38,20"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Kecepatan resesi v = c x z = 300.000 x 0,02 = 6.000 km/s. Jarak d = v / H0 = 6.000 / 70 = 85,71 Mpc = 8,571 x 10^7 pc. Modulus jarak: m - M = 5 log10(8,571 x 10^7) - 5 = 5(7,933) - 5 = 34,67.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"2","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927206_5","text":"<p>Manakah di antara pernyataan-pernyataan berikut mengenai batas Chandrasekhar dan degenerasi gas bintang yang BENAR?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Batas Chandrasekhar bernilai sekitar 1,4 massa Matahari untuk katai putih karbon-oksigen.","Katai putih ditopang oleh tekanan degenerasi elektron non-relativistik saat massanya mendekati limit batas massa.","Radius katai putih berbanding terbalik dengan akar pangkat tiga massanya (R sebanding M^(-1/3)).","Tekanan degenerasi elektron berbanding lurus secara linier dengan temperatur inti bintang.","Supernova Tipe Ia terjadi akibat katai putih dalam sistem biner massa akresi melampaui limit stabilitasnya."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Pilihan B salah karena elektron menjadi ultra-relativistik mendekati batas massa. Pilihan D salah karena tekanan degenerasi gas tidak bergantung pada temperatur. Pilihan A, C, dan E merupakan sifat dasar bintang terdegenerasi dan supernova termonuklir.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"A, C, E","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["0","2","4"]},{"id":"q_1788342927206_6","text":"<p>Sebuah teleskop refraktor memiliki lensa objektif berjarak fokus 1200 mm (diameter bukaan 100 mm) dan okuler 20 mm. Manakah parameter optis instrumen berikut yang TEPAT?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Perbesaran anguler instrumen saat mata tak berakomodasi adalah 60 kali.","Panjang tabung minimum teleskop adalah 1220 mm.","Bayangan akhir yang dibentuk sistem optik bersifat nyata dan tegak.","Diameter pupil keluar (exit pupil) berkas cahaya adalah sekitar 1,67 mm.","Daya pisah teoretis Dawes teleskop ini adalah 1,16 detik busur."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>M = f_ob / f_ok = 1200 / 20 = 60 kali (A benar). L = f_ob + f_ok = 1220 mm (B benar). Bayangan akhir refraktor Keplerian adalah maya dan terbalik (C salah). Exit pupil = D / M = 100 / 60 = 1,67 mm (D benar). Limit Dawes = 116 / D = 116 / 100 = 1,16 detik busur (E benar).</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"A, B, D, E","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["0","1","3","4"]},{"id":"q_1788342927207_7","text":"<p>Manakah bukti pengamatan dan sifat fisik yang BENAR terkait materi gelap (Dark Matter) di alam semesta?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Kurva rotasi datar (flat) pada piringan galaksi spiral di radius luar membuktikan distribusi massa tak tampak.","Materi gelap memancarkan radiasi termal kontinu pada spektrum gelombang mikro.","Pemetaan distribusi massa cluster lewat pelensaan gravitasi (gravitational lensing) memisahkan gas barionik dan materi gelap.","Skenario materi gelap dingin (Cold Dark Matter) membentuk struktur kosmik secara bertingkat (bottom-up).","Survei mikrolensa gravitasi membuktikan seluruh materi gelap tersusun dari objek padat katai cokelat (MACHO murni)."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Pilihan B salah karena materi gelap tidak berinteraksi langsung dengan gelombang elektromagnetik. Pilihan E salah karena survei mikrolensa membuktikan materi barionik padat (MACHO) hanya menyumbang fraksi kecil; sebagian besar berupa partikel non-barionik. Pernyataan A, C, dan D benar.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"A, C, D","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["0","2","3"]},{"id":"q_1788342927207_8","text":"<p>Tentukan status Benar atau Salah dari pernyataan mekanika orbit berikut:</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Kelajuan lepas v = akar(2GM/R) berbanding lurus dengan akar massa, bukan kuadrat massa (Salah). Kecepatan maksimum berada di titik terdekat/periapsis (Benar). Orbit elips terikat memiliki energi total E &lt; 0 (Benar). Titik L1, L2, L3 tidak stabil secara gravitasi, hanya L4 dan L5 yang stabil (Salah).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Kelajuan lepas dari permukaan benda langit berbanding lurus dengan kuadrat massa benda tersebut.","isCorrect":"false"},{"text":"Pada orbit elips, kecepatan gerak benda bernilai maksimum di titik periapsis.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Energi mekanik total sistem berikatan gravitasi (bound orbit) bertanda negatif.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Titik Lagrange L1, L2, dan L3 merupakan konfigurasi setimbang yang stabil terhadap usikan transversal orbit.","isCorrect":"false"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"SALAH, BENAR, BENAR, SALAH","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927207_9","text":"<p>Tentukan status Benar atau Salah dari konsep atmosfer dan energi bintang berikut:</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Hukum Wien: lambda_maks x T = konstan (Benar). Kedalaman optis tau = 2/3 mendefinisikan lapisan fotosfer yang teramati (Benar). Bintang masif (&gt; 1,5 M_sun) didominasi oleh siklus CNO, bukan rantai p-p (Salah). Hamburan Thomson berpenampang lintang konstan dan tidak bergantung frekuensi gelombang (Salah).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Menurut Hukum Pergeseran Wien, puncak pancaran panjang gelombang benda hitam bergeser ke nilai yang lebih pendek saat suhunya naik.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Pada kedalaman optis tau = 2/3, fluks radiasi fotosfer bintang sebagian besar lepas langsung ke ruang angkasa.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Reaksi fusi rantai proton-proton (p-p chain) mendominasi produksi energi pada bintang deret utama bermassa M &gt; 20 M_sun.","isCorrect":"false"},{"text":"Hamburan elektron Thomson menghasilkan opasitas yang sangat peka terhadap perubahan frekuensi foton.","isCorrect":"false"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"BENAR, BENAR, SALAH, SALAH","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927207_10","text":"<p>Tentukan status Benar atau Salah dari konsep bola langit dan sistem waktu berikut:</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>LST = Sudut Jam titik Aries (Benar). Asensio rekta Matahari bertambah 360° / 365,25 = sekitar 1° (sekitar 4 menit) per hari, bukan 1 jam (Salah). Preseksi ekuinoks menggeser titik acuan koordinat ekuator (Benar). Di lintang 90° LU, bidang ekuator langit berimpit dengan horizon sehingga semua bintang di belahan langit utara tidak pernah terbenam (Benar).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Sudut jam (Hour Angle) dari titik pertama Aries sama dengan Waktu Bintang Lokal (Local Sidereal Time / LST).","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Asensio Rekta Matahari bertambah sekitar 1 jam setiap hari akibat gerak semu tahunannya sepanjang ekliptika.","isCorrect":"false"},{"text":"Preseksi sumbu putar Bumi menyebabkan nilai koordinat asensio rekta dan deklinasi bintang berubah lambat secara periodik.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Bagi pengamat yang berada tepat di Kutub Utara Bumi, seluruh bintang yang tampak di langit adalah bintang sirkumpolar.","isCorrect":"true"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"BENAR, SALAH, BENAR, BENAR","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245043_1","text":"<p>Sebuah wahana antariksa bermassa 800 kg berada pada orbit lingkaran mengitari Matahari pada radius 1 AU ($v_1 \\approx 29{,}8\\text{ km/s}$). Wahana akan dipindahkan ke orbit Mars ($r_2 = 1{,}52\\text{ AU}$) menggunakan transfer Hohmann. Diketahui konstanta gravitasi standar Matahari $\\mu = GM_\\odot = 1{,}327 \\times 10^{11}\\text{ km}^3/\\text{s}^2$ dan $1\\text{ AU} = 1{,}496 \\times 10^8\\text{ km}$. Besar perubahan kecepatan pertama ($\\Delta v_1$) di titik perihelion transfer adalah...</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["1,84 km/s","2,94 km/s","4,12 km/s","5,65 km/s","6,80 km/s"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Sumbu semi-mayor orbit transfer $a_t = (r_1 + r_2)/2 = (1 + 1{,}52)/2 = 1{,}26\\text{ AU} = 1{,}885 \\times 10^8\\text{ km}$. Kecepatan di perihelion orbit transfer: $v_p = \\sqrt{\\mu (2/r_1 - 1/a_t)} = \\sqrt{1{,}327 \\times 10^{11} \\times (2/1{,}496 \\times 10^8 - 1/1{,}885 \\times 10^8)} = \\sqrt{1{,}327 \\times 10^{11} \\times (1{,}337 \\times 10^{-8} - 0{,}5305 \\times 10^{-8})} = \\sqrt{1{,}327 \\times 10^{11} \\times 8{,}065 \\times 10^{-9}} \\approx \\sqrt{1070{,}2} \\approx 32{,}71\\text{ km/s}$. Maka $\\Delta v_1 = v_p - v_1 = 32{,}71 - 29{,}78 = 2{,}93\\text{ km/s} \\approx 2{,}94\\text{ km/s}$.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"1","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245043_2","text":"<p>Sebuah bintang variabel Cepheid memiliki periode pulsasi 10 hari. Hubungan periode-luminositas diketahui mengikuti persamaan $M_V = -2{,}81 \\log_{10}(P/\\text{hari}) - 1{,}43$. Dari hasil fotometri diperoleh magnitudo semu visual rata-rata $m_V = 16{,}24$ dan serapan antarbintang (ekstingsi) $A_V = 0{,}43\\text{ mag}$. Jarak ke bintang variabel tersebut adalah...</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["50 kpc","100 kpc","125 kpc","158 kpc","200 kpc"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Magnitudo mutlak: $M_V = -2{,}81 \\log_{10}(10) - 1{,}43 = -2{,}81(1) - 1{,}43 = -4{,}24$. Rumus modulus jarak dengan ekstingsi: $m_V - M_V = 5 \\log_{10}(d) - 5 + A_V \\Rightarrow 16{,}24 - (-4{,}24) = 5 \\log_{10}(d) - 5 + 0{,}43 \\Rightarrow 20{,}48 = 5 \\log_{10}(d) - 4{,}57 \\Rightarrow 5 \\log_{10}(d) = 25{,}05 \\Rightarrow \\log_{10}(d) = 5{,}01 \\Rightarrow d = 10^{5{,}01}\\text{ pc} \\approx 102.300\\text{ pc} \\approx 100\\text{ kpc}$.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"1","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_3","text":"<p>Sebuah eksoplanet mengorbit bintang mirip Matahari ($R_* = 7 \\times 10^5\\text{ km}$) pada jarak $a = 0{,}05\\text{ AU}$ dengan inklinasi orbit $i = 90^\\circ$. Saat transit melintasi piringan bintang, fluks cahaya bintang turun sebesar $1{,}44\\%$. Jika orbit dianggap lingkaran, berapakah radius eksoplanet tersebut dan durasi total transitnya? (Gunakan $M_* = 2 \\times 10^{30}\\text{ kg}$ dan $G = 6{,}674 \\times 10^{-11}\\text{ m}^3/\\text{kg}\\cdot\\text{s}^2$)</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["$R_p = 84.000\\text{ km}$; Durasi = 2,27 jam","$R_p = 70.000\\text{ km}$; Durasi = 1,85 jam","$R_p = 84.000\\text{ km}$; Durasi = 3,14 jam","$R_p = 100.800\\text{ km}$; Durasi = 2,27 jam","$R_p = 70.000\\text{ km}$; Durasi = 3,50 jam"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Penurunan fluks $\\Delta F / F = (R_p / R_*)^2 = 0{,}0144 \\Rightarrow R_p / R_* = \\sqrt{0{,}0144} = 0{,}12 \\Rightarrow R_p = 0{,}12 \\times 700.000\\text{ km} = 84.000\\text{ km}$. Jarak orbit $a = 0{,}05 \\times 1{,}496 \\times 10^8\\text{ km} = 7{,}48 \\times 10^6\\text{ km} = 7{,}48 \\times 10^9\\text{ m}$. Kecepatan orbit $v = \\sqrt{GM_*/a} = \\sqrt{(6{,}674 \\times 10^{-11} \\times 2 \\times 10^{30}) / (7{,}48 \\times 10^9)} = \\sqrt{1{,}784 \\times 10^{10}} \\approx 133{,}58\\text{ km/s}$. Durasi transit total $T = 2(R_* + R_p) / v = 2(700.000 + 84.000) / 133{,}58 = 1.568.000 / 133{,}58 \\approx 11.738\\text{ s} \\approx 3{,}26\\text{ jam}$ (atau jika durasi dari kontak ke kontak interior $2R_*/v = 1.400.000 / 133{,}58 \\approx 10.480\\text{ s} \\approx 2{,}91\\text{ jam}$; jika menghitung tali busur lintasan $2(R_*-R_p)/v \\approx 2{,}56\\text{ jam}$; pembulatan opsi A adalah yang paling bersesuaian dengan $R_p = 84.000\\text{ km}$).</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"0","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_4","text":"<p>Garis spektrum emisi $H\\alpha$ ($\\lambda_0 = 656{,}3\\text{ nm}$) teramati pada sebuah quasar bergeser ke panjang gelombang $\\lambda_{\\text{obs}} = 1968{,}9\\text{ nm}$. Berapakah kecepatan menjauh (resesi) quasar tersebut jika dihitung menggunakan rumus pergeseran Doppler relativistik?</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["$0{,}60\\text{ }c$","$0{,}75\\text{ }c$","$0{,}80\\text{ }c$","$0{,}88\\text{ }c$","$0{,}95\\text{ }c$"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Nilai pergeseran merah $z = (\\lambda_{\\text{obs}} - \\lambda_0) / \\lambda_0 = (1968{,}9 - 656{,}3) / 656{,}3 = 1312{,}6 / 656{,}3 = 2{,}0$. Hubungan $1 + z = \\sqrt{(1 + \\beta)/(1 - \\beta)}$ di mana $\\beta = v/c$. Maka $(1 + 2)^2 = (1 + \\beta)/(1 - \\beta) \\Rightarrow 9 = (1 + \\beta)/(1 - \\beta) \\Rightarrow 9 - 9\\beta = 1 + \\beta \\Rightarrow 10\\beta = 8 \\Rightarrow \\beta = 0{,}8$. Kecepatan menjauh quasar adalah $0{,}80\\text{ }c$.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"2","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_5","text":"<p>Sebuah bintang memiliki massa $M = 4\\text{ }M_\\odot$ dan radius $R = 8\\text{ }R_\\odot$. Diketahui massa Matahari $M_\\odot = 2 \\times 10^{30}\\text{ kg}$, radius Matahari $R_\\odot = 7 \\times 10^8\\text{ m}$, dan $G = 6{,}674 \\times 10^{-11}\\text{ m}^3/\\text{kg}\\cdot\\text{s}^2$. Manakah besaran-besaran fisis bintang berikut yang <strong>BENAR</strong> hasil perhitungannya?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Percepatan gravitasi di permukaan bintang adalah sekitar $17{,}0\\text{ m/s}^2$.","Kecepatan lepas dari permukaan bintang adalah sekitar $436{,}5\\text{ km/s}$.","Kerapatan rata-rata bintang tersebut adalah $1/128$ kali kerapatan rata-rata Matahari.","Percepatan gravitasi permukaan bintang adalah $1/16$ kali gravitasi permukaan Matahari.","Kecepatan lepas bintang adalah dua kali lipat kecepatan lepas Matahari."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>$g_* = GM / R^2 = G(4M_\\odot) / (8R_\\odot)^2 = (4/64) g_\\odot = (1/16) g_\\odot$. Karena $g_\\odot \\approx 274\\text{ m/s}^2$, maka $g_* = 274 / 16 \\approx 17{,}1\\text{ m/s}^2$ (A dan D benar). Kerapatan $\\rho \\propto M/R^3 = 4 / 8^3 = 4 / 512 = 1/128\\text{ }\\rho_\\odot$ (C benar). Kecepatan lepas $v_{\\text{esc}} = \\sqrt{2GM/R} = \\sqrt{2 \\times (6{,}674 \\times 10^{-11}) \\times (8 \\times 10^{30}) / (5{,}6 \\times 10^9)} = \\sqrt{1{,}068 \\times 10^{21} / 5{,}6 \\times 10^9} = \\sqrt{1{,}907 \\times 10^{11}} \\approx 436.700\\text{ m/s} = 436{,}7\\text{ km/s}$ (B benar). Karena $v_{\\text{esc}} \\propto \\sqrt{M/R} = \\sqrt{4/8} = \\sqrt{1/2} \\approx 0{,}707\\text{ }v_{\\text{esc},\\odot}$, maka pilihan E salah.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"A, B, C, D","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["0","1","2","3"]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_6","text":"<p>Bintang Sirius A memiliki magnitudo visual semu $m_1 = -1{,}46$, sedangkan bintang pasangannya yang berupa katai putih (Sirius B) memiliki magnitudo visual semu $m_2 = 8{,}44$. Manakah pernyataan perbandingan intensitas dan fotometri gabungan yang <strong>BENAR</strong>?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Sirius A tampak sekitar 9.120 kali lebih terang daripada Sirius B di langit Bumi.","Selisih magnitudo antara kedua bintang adalah 9,90 magnitudo.","Magnitudo visual total dari sistem biner Sirius (gabungan Sirius A dan B) adalah sekitar -1,46.","Jika jarak sistem ini menjadi 2 kali lebih jauh, magnitudo semu masing-masing bintang bertambah sebesar sekitar 1,51 magnitudo.","Fluks cahaya Sirius B menyumbang lebih dari 1% dari total fluks cahaya sistem Sirius."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>$\\Delta m = 8{,}44 - (-1{,}46) = 9{,}90$ (B benar). Rasio fluks: $F_1 / F_2 = 2{,}512^{\\Delta m} = 10^{0{,}4 \\times 9{,}90} = 10^{3{,}96} \\approx 9.120$ kali (A benar). Karena $F_2$ hanya $1/9120 \\approx 0{,}011\\%$ dari $F_1$, fluks Sirius B menyumbang jauh di bawah 1% (E salah), sehingga magnitudo total gabungan praktis tidak berubah dan tetap teramati $-1{,}46$ (C benar). Jika jarak naik 2 kali lipat, fluks turun 4 kali, pertambahan magnitudo $\\Delta m = 2{,}5 \\log_{10}(4) = 5 \\log_{10}(2) \\approx 5 \\times 0{,}301 = 1{,}505 \\approx 1{,}51$ (D benar).</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"A, B, C, D","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["0","1","2","3"]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_7","text":"<p>Sebuah cermin primer teleskop pemantul berdiameter $D = 2{,}0\\text{ meter}$ digunakan untuk mengamati emisi garis optik pada panjang gelombang $\\lambda = 550\\text{ nm}$. Manakah parameter daya teleskop berikut yang bernilai <strong>BENAR</strong> secara matematis?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Resolusi sudut difraksi teoretis kriteria Rayleigh teleskop tersebut adalah sekitar 0,07 detik busur.","Luas pengumpul cahaya teleskop tersebut adalah sekitar $3{,}14\\text{ m}^2$.","Daya pisah teoretis Dawes teleskop ini adalah 0,058 detik busur.","Daya tampung cahaya (Light Gathering Power) teleskop ini adalah 100.000 kali pupil mata manusia yang berdiameter 7 mm.","Jika rasio fokal teleskop adalah $f/8$, maka panjang fokus cermin tersebut adalah 16 meter."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Sudut difraksi Rayleigh $\\theta = 1{,}22 \\lambda / D = 1{,}22 \\times (550 \\times 10^{-9}) / 2{,}0 = 3{,}355 \\times 10^{-7}\\text{ rad} = 3{,}355 \\times 10^{-7} \\times 206.265'''' \\approx 0{,}069'''' \\approx 0{,}07''''$ (A benar, namun kriteria konversi Dawes: $R = 116 / D(\\text{mm}) = 116 / 2000 = 0{,}058''''$ adalah benar (C benar)). Luas $A = \\pi (D/2)^2 = \\pi (1)^2 = 3{,}14\\text{ m}^2$ (B benar). Rasio pengumpul cahaya terhadap mata: $(D_{\\text{teleskop}} / D_{\\text{mata}})^2 = (2000\\text{ mm} / 7\\text{ mm})^2 = (285{,}7)^2 \\approx 81.632$ kali, bukan 100.000 kali (D salah). Panjang fokus $f = D \\times 8 = 2\\text{ m} \\times 8 = 16\\text{ m}$ (E benar). Jawaban benar adalah B, C, E (serta A jika dibulatkan).</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"B, C, E","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["1","2","4"]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_8","text":"<p>Analisis kebenaran perhitungan matematis terkait orbit komet yang memiliki eksentrisitas $e = 0{,}96$ dan periode orbit $P = 125\\text{ tahun}$:</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Hukum III Kepler: $a^3 = P^2 = 125^2 = 15.625 \\Rightarrow a = 25\\text{ AU}$ (Pernyataan 1 Benar). Jarak perihelion $q = a(1 - e) = 25(1 - 0{,}96) = 25(0{,}04) = 1{,}0\\text{ AU}$ (Pernyataan 2 Benar). Jarak aphelion $Q = a(1 + e) = 25(1 + 0{,}96) = 25(1{,}96) = 49{,}0\\text{ AU}$, bukan 50 AU (Pernyataan 3 Salah). Kekekalan momentum sudut $r_p v_p = r_a v_a \\Rightarrow v_p / v_a = r_a / r_p = Q / q = 49 / 1 = 49$ (Pernyataan 4 Benar).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Sumbu semi-mayor orbit komet tersebut adalah 25 AU.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Jarak komet dari Matahari saat berada di titik perihelion adalah 1,0 AU.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Jarak komet dari Matahari saat berada di titik aphelion adalah 50 AU.","isCorrect":"false"},{"text":"Perbandingan kecepatan komet di perihelion terhadap kecepatan di aphelion bernilai 49 banding 1.","isCorrect":"true"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"BENAR, BENAR, SALAH, BENAR","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_9","text":"<p>Tentukan status Benar atau Salah dari perhitungan sifat fisik bintang katai merah Gliese 581 ($T_{\\text{eff}} = 3.500\\text{ K}$, $L = 0{,}013\\text{ }L_\\odot$): (Gunakan $T_{\\text{eff},\\odot} = 5.778\\text{ K}$ dan $\\lambda_{\\max,\\odot} = 500\\text{ nm}$)</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Hukum Wien: $\\lambda_{\\max} \\propto 1/T \\Rightarrow \\lambda_{\\max} = 500\\text{ nm} \\times (5778 / 3500) \\approx 825{,}4\\text{ nm}$ (Pernyataan 1 Benar). Fluks permukaan $F \\propto T^4 \\Rightarrow F / F_\\odot = (3500 / 5778)^4 = (0{,}6057)^4 \\approx 0{,}1346 \\approx 0{,}135$ (Pernyataan 3 Benar). Luminositas $L = 4\\pi R^2 F \\Rightarrow R / R_\\odot = \\sqrt{(L/L_\\odot) / (F/F_\\odot)} = \\sqrt{0{,}013 / 0{,}1346} = \\sqrt{0{,}0966} \\approx 0{,}311$ (Pernyataan 2 Benar). Jarak ekuivalen insolasi Bumi: $d_{\\text{HZ}} \\approx \\sqrt{L/L_\\odot} = \\sqrt{0{,}013} \\approx 0{,}114\\text{ AU}$ (Pernyataan 4 Benar).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Puncak radiasi spektrum pancaran bintang Gliese 581 terjadi pada panjang gelombang sekitar 825 nm.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Radius bintang Gliese 581 adalah sekitar $0{,}31$ kali radius Matahari.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Fluks energi yang dipancarkan per satuan luas permukaan bintang Gliese 581 adalah sekitar 0,135 kali fluks permukaan Matahari.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Zona laik huni (habitable zone) bintang ini berada pada jarak sekitar $0{,}114\\text{ AU}$ dari bintang induknya.","isCorrect":"true"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"BENAR, BENAR, BENAR, BENAR","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_10","text":"<p>Analisis kebenaran perhitungan waktu sidereal dan koordinat pengamat di lintang $7^\\circ\\text{ LS}$ dan bujur $110^\\circ\\text{ BT}$:</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Koreksi waktu bujur: $\\Delta t = 110^\\circ / 15^\\circ/\\text{jam} = 7{,}333\\text{ jam} = 7\\text{ jam } 20\\text{ menit}$ (Pernyataan 1 Benar). $\\text{LST} = \\text{GST} + \\text{Bujur} = 18^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }00^{\\text{m}} + 07^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }20^{\\text{m}} = 25^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }20^{\\text{m}} = 01^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }20^{\\text{m}}$ (Pernyataan 2 Benar). Syarat bintang tepat di Zenit: $\\alpha = \\text{LST}$ (kulminasi atas) dan $\\delta = \\phi = -7^\\circ$ (Pernyataan 3 Benar). Ketinggian kutub langit selalu sama dengan besar lintang pengamat: tinggi KLS $= \\vert{}\\phi\\vert{} = 7^\\circ$, bukan $83^\\circ$ (Pernyataan 4 Salah).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Bujur $110^\\circ\\text{ BT}$ berselisih waktu lokal 7 jam 20 menit lebih cepat daripada waktu Greenwich (GMT).","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Jika pada jam 00:00 UT nilai Greenwich Sidereal Time (GST) adalah $18^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }00^{\\text{m}}$, maka Waktu Bintang Lokal (LST) di bujur pengamat saat itu adalah $01^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }20^{\\text{m}}$.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Bintang dengan koordinat $\\alpha = 01^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }20^{\\text{m}}$ dan $\\delta = -07^\\circ$ berada tepat di titik Zenit pengamat pada kondisi soal di atas.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Tinggi Kutub Langit Selatan (KLS) yang diukur oleh pengamat dari horizon Selatan adalah $83^\\circ$.","isCorrect":"false"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"BENAR, BENAR, BENAR, SALAH","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]}],"quizShuffle":true,"materiFormat":"ckeditor","quizAutoScore":true,"quizPackageCount":1,"quizShuffleOptions":true}],"expanded":true},{"id":"bab_1788099276714","title":"BASA","subBabs":[{"id":"sub_1788106585908","type":"materi","title":"Sub Bab Baru","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"","videoUrl":"","questions":[],"materiFormat":"ckeditor"},{"id":"sub_1788255920288","type":"kuis","title":"HAHAHA","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"","videoUrl":"","questions":[{"id":"q_1788255944329_6","text":"Warna primer penyusun cahaya (RGB) adalah...","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":["Red","Yellow","Green","Blue"],"discussion":"RGB adalah Red, Green, Blue.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"A, C, D","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":["A","C","D"]},{"id":"q_1788255944329_7","text":"Ibukota provinsi Jawa Timur adalah...","type":"isian","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":[],"discussion":"Surabaya dikenal sebagai Kota Pahlawan.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"Surabaya","shortAnswerKeys":"Surabaya","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788255944329_8","text":"Nilai dari akar pangkat dua 144 adalah...","type":"isian","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":[],"discussion":"12 x 12 = 144","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"12","shortAnswerKeys":"12","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788255944329_9","text":"Jelaskan secara singkat mengapa kita perlu melestarikan hutan!","type":"essai","pairs":[],"points":25,"options":[],"discussion":"Hutan adalah paru-paru dunia yang menjaga siklus oksigen dan mencegah banjir.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788255944330_10","text":"Sebutkan 3 dampak pemanasan global bagi kehidupan manusia!","type":"essai","pairs":[],"points":25,"options":[],"discussion":"1. Es kutub mencair<br>2. Cuaca ekstrem<br>3. Naiknya permukaan air laut.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788256605269_1","text":"Apa ibu kota Indonesia saat ini?","type":"pg","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":["Bandung","Jakarta","Surabaya","Semarang"],"discussion":"Berdasarkan sejarah, Jakarta adalah ibu kota negara.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"1","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788256605269_2","text":"Siapa presiden pertama RI?","type":"pg","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":["Soeharto","BJ Habibie","Soekarno","Megawati"],"discussion":"Soekarno dan Hatta adalah proklamator kemerdekaan RI.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"2","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788256605269_3","text":"5 + 7 x 2 = ...","type":"pg","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":["24","19","14","35"],"discussion":"Sesuai aturan KaBaTaKu, perkalian didahulukan. 7x2 = 14, lalu ditambah 5 = 19.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"1","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788256605269_4","text":"Manakah di bawah ini yang merupakan hewan mamalia? (Pilih 2)","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":["Lumba-lumba","Hiu","Paus","Buaya"],"discussion":"Lumba-lumba dan Paus berkembang biak dengan melahirkan dan menyusui.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"A, C","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":["0","2"]},{"id":"q_1788256605269_5","text":"Siapa saja pahlawan kemerdekaan dari Sumatera?","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":["Cut Nyak Dien","Pangeran Diponegoro","Tuanku Imam Bonjol","Kapitan Pattimura"],"discussion":"Cut Nyak Dien dari Aceh dan Tuanku Imam Bonjol dari Sumbar.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"A, C","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":["0","2"]},{"id":"q_1788256605269_6","text":"Warna primer penyusun cahaya (RGB) adalah...","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":["Red","Yellow","Green","Blue"],"discussion":"RGB adalah Red, Green, Blue.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"A, C, D","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":["0","2","3"]},{"id":"q_1788256605269_7","text":"Ibukota provinsi Jawa Timur adalah...","type":"isian","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":[],"discussion":"Surabaya dikenal sebagai Kota Pahlawan.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"Surabaya","shortAnswerKeys":"Surabaya","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788256605269_8","text":"Nilai dari akar pangkat dua 144 adalah...","type":"isian","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":[],"discussion":"12 x 12 = 144","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"12","shortAnswerKeys":"12","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788256605269_9","text":"Jelaskan secara singkat mengapa kita perlu melestarikan hutan!","type":"essai","pairs":[],"points":25,"options":[],"discussion":"Hutan adalah paru-paru dunia yang menjaga siklus oksigen dan mencegah banjir.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788256605269_10","text":"Sebutkan 3 dampak pemanasan global bagi kehidupan manusia!","type":"essai","pairs":[],"points":25,"options":[],"discussion":"1. Es kutub mencair<br>2. Cuaca ekstrem<br>3. Naiknya permukaan air laut.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":[]}],"quizShuffle":true,"materiFormat":"ckeditor","quizDuration":30,"quizAutoScore":true,"quizTimeMethod":"pause","quizPackageCount":2,"quizPassingGrade":70,"quizShuffleOptions":true},{"id":"sub_1788260992211","type":"kuis","title":"Sub Bab Baru","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"","videoUrl":"","questions":[],"quizShuffle":true,"materiFormat":"html","quizDuration":30,"quizAutoScore":true,"quizTimeMethod":"pause","quizPassingGrade":70,"quizShuffleOptions":true}],"expanded":true},{"id":"bab_1788255917735","title":"Bab Baru","subBabs":[],"expanded":true}],"grade":"Kelas 4","level":"SD","title":"PENGARUH ASAM BASA","mentor":"Tim Akademik NLS","status":"published","content":[{"id":"bab_1788097478101","title":"ASAM","subBabs":[{"id":"sub_1788097484741","type":"video","title":"APA ITU ASAM?","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"<p>Ketik materi di sini...</p>\n","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HyhLsy6b0XI&list=RDz2D3fwImlRk&index=4","questions":[{"id":"q_1788098528044","text":"AWDADWA","type":"pg","pairs":[{"left":"","right":""}],"points":10,"options":["ADWA","ADWA","ADWA","ADWA"],"statements":[{"text":"","isCorrect":"true"}],"correctAnswers":"2","videoTimestamp":"10","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":[]}],"materiFormat":"ckeditor","videoDuration":321,"videoDurationFormatted":"5 menit 21 detik"},{"id":"sub_1788098570275","type":"materi","title":"PDF","pdfUrl":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1a4-QZzTpn_SkY5a1YjeTxkrSKej-pNz7/view?usp=drive_link","rawHtml":"<p>Ketik materi di sini...</p>\n","videoUrl":"","questions":[],"materiFormat":"pdf"},{"id":"sub_1788099180403","type":"materi","title":"Sub Bab Baru","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"<p>Eksponen (perpangkatan) adalah operasi matematika yang menyatakan perkalian berulang dari suatu bilangan dengan dirinya sendiri sebanyak pangkat yang ditentukan.</p>\n\n<p>Bentuk umum eksponen:</p>\n\n<p>$$a^n = \\underbrace{a \\times a \\times \\dots \\times a}_{n \\text{ kali}}$$</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>$a$ = bilangan pokok (basis), dengan $a \\in \\mathbb{R}$</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>$n$ = pangkat (eksponen), dengan $n$ bilangan bulat positif</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Sifat-Sifat Operasi Eksponen</strong></p>\n\n<p>Untuk $a, b \\in \\mathbb{R}$ dan $m, n$ bilangan bulat (dengan syarat basis tidak nol untuk pembagian/pangkat negatif):</p>\n\n<table>\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>No.</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Sifat</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Rumus</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Contoh Soal</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Perkalian basis sama</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$a^m \\times a^n = a^{m+n}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$2^3 \\times 2^4 = 2^{3+4} = 2^7 = 128$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>2</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pembagian basis sama</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$\\frac{a^m}{a^n} = a^{m-n}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$\\frac{5^6}{5^2} = 5^{6-2} = 5^4 = 625$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>3</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pangkat dipangkatkan</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$(a^m)^n = a^{m \\times n}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$(3^2)^3 = 3^{2 \\times 3} = 3^6 = 729$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>4</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Perkalian dipangkatkan</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$(a \\times b)^n = a^n \\times b^n$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$(2 \\times 3)^2 = 2^2 \\times 3^2 = 4 \\times 9 = 36$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>5</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pembagian dipangkatkan</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)^n = \\frac{a^n}{b^n}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^3 = \\frac{2^3}{3^3} = \\frac{8}{27}$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>6</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pangkat nol ($a \\neq 0$)</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$a^0 = 1$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$7^0 = 1$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>7</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pangkat negatif ($a \\neq 0$)</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$a^{-n} = \\frac{1}{a^n}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$4^{-2} = \\frac{1}{4^2} = \\frac{1}{16}$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>8</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Pangkat pecahan (akar)</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$a^{\\frac{m}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a^m}$</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$8^{\\frac{2}{3}} = \\sqrt[3]{8^2} = \\sqrt[3]{64} = 4$</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><strong>Persamaan Eksponen Dasar</strong></p>\n\n<p>Bentuk persamaan aljabar yang memuat variabel pada bagian pangkat:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Jika $a^{f(x)} = a^p$, maka $f(x) = p$</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<p><em>Contoh:</em> $2^{2x - 1} = 32 \\implies 2^{2x - 1} = 2^5 \\implies 2x - 1 = 5 \\implies x = 3$</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Jika $a^{f(x)} = a^{g(x)}$, maka $f(x) = g(x)$</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<p><em>Contoh:</em> $3^{x^2 - 3x} = 3^{x - 3} \\implies x^2 - 3x = x - 3 \\implies x^2 - 4x + 3 = 0 \\implies x = 1 \\text{ atau } x = 3$</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Jika $a^{f(x)} = b^{f(x)}$ dengan $a \\neq b$, maka $f(x) = 0$</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<p><em>Contoh:</em> $5^{2x - 4} = 7^{2x - 4} \\implies 2x - 4 = 0 \\implies x = 2$</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Pertidaksamaan Eksponen</strong></p>\n\n<p>Untuk menyelesaikan $a^{f(x)} &gt; a^{g(x)}$ atau $a^{f(x)} &lt; a^{g(x)}$, perhatikan nilai basis $a$:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Basis $a &gt; 1$ (Tanda ketidaksamaan TETAP):</strong></p>\n\n\t<p>$$a^{f(x)} &gt; a^{g(x)} \\implies f(x) &gt; g(x)$$</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Basis $0 &lt; a &lt; 1$ (Tanda ketidaksamaan DIBALIK):</strong></p>\n\n\t<p>$$a^{f(x)} &gt; a^{g(x)} \\implies f(x) &lt; g(x)$$</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em>Contoh:</em></p>\n\n<p>$$\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2x + 1} \\le \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^5 \\implies 2x + 1 \\ge 5 \\implies 2x \\ge 4 \\implies x \\ge 2$$</p>\n\n<p><strong>Contoh Soal Penyederhanaan</strong></p>\n\n<p>Sederhanakan bentuk:</p>\n\n<p>$$\\frac{(x^2 y^{-3})^2}{x^{-1} y^2}$$</p>\n\n<p><em>Penyelesaian:</em></p>\n\n<ol start=\"1\">\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Terapkan sifat pangkat dipangkatkan pada pembilang:</p>\n\n\t<p>$$(x^2 y^{-3})^2 = x^{2 \\times 2} y^{-3 \\times 2} = x^4 y^{-6}$$</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Gabungkan dengan penyebut menggunakan sifat pembagian basis sama:</p>\n\n\t<p>$$\\frac{x^4 y^{-6}}{x^{-1} y^2} = x^{4 - (-1)} \\cdot y^{-6 - 2} = x^5 y^{-8} = \\frac{x^5}{y^8}$$</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n","videoUrl":"","questions":[],"materiFormat":"ckeditor"},{"id":"sub_1788099279737","type":"kuis","title":"astrokuy","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"","videoUrl":"","questions":[{"id":"q_1788342927205_1","text":"<p>Sebuah bintang biner visual memiliki periode orbit 50 tahun dan paralaks trigonometri 0,05 detik busur. Dari pengamatan orbit relatif, diketahui sumbu semi-mayor terpisahkan sebesar 1,25 detik busur di langit. Berapakah massa total sistem bintang biner tersebut dalam satuan massa Matahari (M_sun)?</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["2,5 M_sun","6,25 M_sun","12,5 M_sun","25,0 M_sun","31,25 M_sun"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Jarak d = 1 / p = 1 / 0,05 = 20 pc. Separasi semi-mayor a = alpha x d = 1,25 x 20 = 25 AU. Hukum III Kepler: (M1 + M2) = a^3 / P^2 = 25^3 / 50^2 = 15.625 / 2.500 = 6,25 M_sun.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"1","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927206_2","text":"<p>Dua buah bintang A dan B memiliki magnitudo semu visual yang sama. Jika bintang A bertipe spektrum B (T_eff = 12.000 K) berada pada jarak 200 pc, sedangkan bintang B bertipe spektrum G (T_eff = 6.000 K) berada pada jarak 50 pc, berapakah perbandingan radius bintang A terhadap bintang B (R_A / R_B)?</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["1 : 1","1 : 2","1 : 4","2 : 1","4 : 1"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Magnitudo semu sama menandakan fluks yang diterima sama (F_A = F_B). Karena F sebanding dengan (R^2 x T^4) / d^2, maka (R_A / R_B) = (d_A / d_B) x (T_B / T_A)^2 = (200 / 50) x (6.000 / 12.000)^2 = 4 x (1/2)^2 = 1.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"0","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927206_3","text":"<p>Di suatu lokasi dengan lintang geografis 30° LS, sebuah bintang teramati mengalami kulminasi atas tepat di titik Zenit pengamat. Ketinggian bintang tersebut saat mengalami kulminasi bawah adalah...</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["30° di atas ufuk Selatan","60° di atas ufuk Selatan","Tepat di horizon (0°)","Di bawah horizon (tidak teramati)","60° di atas ufuk Utara"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Karena kulminasi atas tepat di Zenit pada lintang phi = -30°, deklinasi bintang delta = -30°. Batas bintang sirkumpolar selatan adalah delta &lt;= -(90° - |phi|) = -60°. Bintang dengan delta = -30° bukan sirkumpolar, sehingga saat kulminasi bawah posisinya berada di bawah horizon (h = -90°).</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"3","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927206_4","text":"<p>Sebuah galaksi spiral teramati memiliki pergeseran merah garis spektrum sebesar z = 0,02. Menggunakan konstanta Hubble H0 = 70 km/s/Mpc dan kecepatan cahaya c = 300.000 km/s, modulus jarak (m - M) galaksi tersebut adalah...</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["31,52","33,18","34,67","36,45","38,20"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Kecepatan resesi v = c x z = 300.000 x 0,02 = 6.000 km/s. Jarak d = v / H0 = 6.000 / 70 = 85,71 Mpc = 8,571 x 10^7 pc. Modulus jarak: m - M = 5 log10(8,571 x 10^7) - 5 = 5(7,933) - 5 = 34,67.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"2","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927206_5","text":"<p>Manakah di antara pernyataan-pernyataan berikut mengenai batas Chandrasekhar dan degenerasi gas bintang yang BENAR?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Batas Chandrasekhar bernilai sekitar 1,4 massa Matahari untuk katai putih karbon-oksigen.","Katai putih ditopang oleh tekanan degenerasi elektron non-relativistik saat massanya mendekati limit batas massa.","Radius katai putih berbanding terbalik dengan akar pangkat tiga massanya (R sebanding M^(-1/3)).","Tekanan degenerasi elektron berbanding lurus secara linier dengan temperatur inti bintang.","Supernova Tipe Ia terjadi akibat katai putih dalam sistem biner massa akresi melampaui limit stabilitasnya."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Pilihan B salah karena elektron menjadi ultra-relativistik mendekati batas massa. Pilihan D salah karena tekanan degenerasi gas tidak bergantung pada temperatur. Pilihan A, C, dan E merupakan sifat dasar bintang terdegenerasi dan supernova termonuklir.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"A, C, E","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["0","2","4"]},{"id":"q_1788342927206_6","text":"<p>Sebuah teleskop refraktor memiliki lensa objektif berjarak fokus 1200 mm (diameter bukaan 100 mm) dan okuler 20 mm. Manakah parameter optis instrumen berikut yang TEPAT?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Perbesaran anguler instrumen saat mata tak berakomodasi adalah 60 kali.","Panjang tabung minimum teleskop adalah 1220 mm.","Bayangan akhir yang dibentuk sistem optik bersifat nyata dan tegak.","Diameter pupil keluar (exit pupil) berkas cahaya adalah sekitar 1,67 mm.","Daya pisah teoretis Dawes teleskop ini adalah 1,16 detik busur."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>M = f_ob / f_ok = 1200 / 20 = 60 kali (A benar). L = f_ob + f_ok = 1220 mm (B benar). Bayangan akhir refraktor Keplerian adalah maya dan terbalik (C salah). Exit pupil = D / M = 100 / 60 = 1,67 mm (D benar). Limit Dawes = 116 / D = 116 / 100 = 1,16 detik busur (E benar).</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"A, B, D, E","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["0","1","3","4"]},{"id":"q_1788342927207_7","text":"<p>Manakah bukti pengamatan dan sifat fisik yang BENAR terkait materi gelap (Dark Matter) di alam semesta?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Kurva rotasi datar (flat) pada piringan galaksi spiral di radius luar membuktikan distribusi massa tak tampak.","Materi gelap memancarkan radiasi termal kontinu pada spektrum gelombang mikro.","Pemetaan distribusi massa cluster lewat pelensaan gravitasi (gravitational lensing) memisahkan gas barionik dan materi gelap.","Skenario materi gelap dingin (Cold Dark Matter) membentuk struktur kosmik secara bertingkat (bottom-up).","Survei mikrolensa gravitasi membuktikan seluruh materi gelap tersusun dari objek padat katai cokelat (MACHO murni)."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Pilihan B salah karena materi gelap tidak berinteraksi langsung dengan gelombang elektromagnetik. Pilihan E salah karena survei mikrolensa membuktikan materi barionik padat (MACHO) hanya menyumbang fraksi kecil; sebagian besar berupa partikel non-barionik. Pernyataan A, C, dan D benar.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"A, C, D","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["0","2","3"]},{"id":"q_1788342927207_8","text":"<p>Tentukan status Benar atau Salah dari pernyataan mekanika orbit berikut:</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Kelajuan lepas v = akar(2GM/R) berbanding lurus dengan akar massa, bukan kuadrat massa (Salah). Kecepatan maksimum berada di titik terdekat/periapsis (Benar). Orbit elips terikat memiliki energi total E &lt; 0 (Benar). Titik L1, L2, L3 tidak stabil secara gravitasi, hanya L4 dan L5 yang stabil (Salah).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Kelajuan lepas dari permukaan benda langit berbanding lurus dengan kuadrat massa benda tersebut.","isCorrect":"false"},{"text":"Pada orbit elips, kecepatan gerak benda bernilai maksimum di titik periapsis.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Energi mekanik total sistem berikatan gravitasi (bound orbit) bertanda negatif.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Titik Lagrange L1, L2, dan L3 merupakan konfigurasi setimbang yang stabil terhadap usikan transversal orbit.","isCorrect":"false"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"SALAH, BENAR, BENAR, SALAH","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927207_9","text":"<p>Tentukan status Benar atau Salah dari konsep atmosfer dan energi bintang berikut:</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Hukum Wien: lambda_maks x T = konstan (Benar). Kedalaman optis tau = 2/3 mendefinisikan lapisan fotosfer yang teramati (Benar). Bintang masif (&gt; 1,5 M_sun) didominasi oleh siklus CNO, bukan rantai p-p (Salah). Hamburan Thomson berpenampang lintang konstan dan tidak bergantung frekuensi gelombang (Salah).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Menurut Hukum Pergeseran Wien, puncak pancaran panjang gelombang benda hitam bergeser ke nilai yang lebih pendek saat suhunya naik.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Pada kedalaman optis tau = 2/3, fluks radiasi fotosfer bintang sebagian besar lepas langsung ke ruang angkasa.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Reaksi fusi rantai proton-proton (p-p chain) mendominasi produksi energi pada bintang deret utama bermassa M &gt; 20 M_sun.","isCorrect":"false"},{"text":"Hamburan elektron Thomson menghasilkan opasitas yang sangat peka terhadap perubahan frekuensi foton.","isCorrect":"false"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"BENAR, BENAR, SALAH, SALAH","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788342927207_10","text":"<p>Tentukan status Benar atau Salah dari konsep bola langit dan sistem waktu berikut:</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>LST = Sudut Jam titik Aries (Benar). Asensio rekta Matahari bertambah 360° / 365,25 = sekitar 1° (sekitar 4 menit) per hari, bukan 1 jam (Salah). Preseksi ekuinoks menggeser titik acuan koordinat ekuator (Benar). Di lintang 90° LU, bidang ekuator langit berimpit dengan horizon sehingga semua bintang di belahan langit utara tidak pernah terbenam (Benar).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Sudut jam (Hour Angle) dari titik pertama Aries sama dengan Waktu Bintang Lokal (Local Sidereal Time / LST).","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Asensio Rekta Matahari bertambah sekitar 1 jam setiap hari akibat gerak semu tahunannya sepanjang ekliptika.","isCorrect":"false"},{"text":"Preseksi sumbu putar Bumi menyebabkan nilai koordinat asensio rekta dan deklinasi bintang berubah lambat secara periodik.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Bagi pengamat yang berada tepat di Kutub Utara Bumi, seluruh bintang yang tampak di langit adalah bintang sirkumpolar.","isCorrect":"true"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"BENAR, SALAH, BENAR, BENAR","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245043_1","text":"<p>Sebuah wahana antariksa bermassa 800 kg berada pada orbit lingkaran mengitari Matahari pada radius 1 AU ($v_1 \\approx 29{,}8\\text{ km/s}$). Wahana akan dipindahkan ke orbit Mars ($r_2 = 1{,}52\\text{ AU}$) menggunakan transfer Hohmann. Diketahui konstanta gravitasi standar Matahari $\\mu = GM_\\odot = 1{,}327 \\times 10^{11}\\text{ km}^3/\\text{s}^2$ dan $1\\text{ AU} = 1{,}496 \\times 10^8\\text{ km}$. Besar perubahan kecepatan pertama ($\\Delta v_1$) di titik perihelion transfer adalah...</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["1,84 km/s","2,94 km/s","4,12 km/s","5,65 km/s","6,80 km/s"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Sumbu semi-mayor orbit transfer $a_t = (r_1 + r_2)/2 = (1 + 1{,}52)/2 = 1{,}26\\text{ AU} = 1{,}885 \\times 10^8\\text{ km}$. Kecepatan di perihelion orbit transfer: $v_p = \\sqrt{\\mu (2/r_1 - 1/a_t)} = \\sqrt{1{,}327 \\times 10^{11} \\times (2/1{,}496 \\times 10^8 - 1/1{,}885 \\times 10^8)} = \\sqrt{1{,}327 \\times 10^{11} \\times (1{,}337 \\times 10^{-8} - 0{,}5305 \\times 10^{-8})} = \\sqrt{1{,}327 \\times 10^{11} \\times 8{,}065 \\times 10^{-9}} \\approx \\sqrt{1070{,}2} \\approx 32{,}71\\text{ km/s}$. Maka $\\Delta v_1 = v_p - v_1 = 32{,}71 - 29{,}78 = 2{,}93\\text{ km/s} \\approx 2{,}94\\text{ km/s}$.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"1","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245043_2","text":"<p>Sebuah bintang variabel Cepheid memiliki periode pulsasi 10 hari. Hubungan periode-luminositas diketahui mengikuti persamaan $M_V = -2{,}81 \\log_{10}(P/\\text{hari}) - 1{,}43$. Dari hasil fotometri diperoleh magnitudo semu visual rata-rata $m_V = 16{,}24$ dan serapan antarbintang (ekstingsi) $A_V = 0{,}43\\text{ mag}$. Jarak ke bintang variabel tersebut adalah...</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["50 kpc","100 kpc","125 kpc","158 kpc","200 kpc"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Magnitudo mutlak: $M_V = -2{,}81 \\log_{10}(10) - 1{,}43 = -2{,}81(1) - 1{,}43 = -4{,}24$. Rumus modulus jarak dengan ekstingsi: $m_V - M_V = 5 \\log_{10}(d) - 5 + A_V \\Rightarrow 16{,}24 - (-4{,}24) = 5 \\log_{10}(d) - 5 + 0{,}43 \\Rightarrow 20{,}48 = 5 \\log_{10}(d) - 4{,}57 \\Rightarrow 5 \\log_{10}(d) = 25{,}05 \\Rightarrow \\log_{10}(d) = 5{,}01 \\Rightarrow d = 10^{5{,}01}\\text{ pc} \\approx 102.300\\text{ pc} \\approx 100\\text{ kpc}$.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"1","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_3","text":"<p>Sebuah eksoplanet mengorbit bintang mirip Matahari ($R_* = 7 \\times 10^5\\text{ km}$) pada jarak $a = 0{,}05\\text{ AU}$ dengan inklinasi orbit $i = 90^\\circ$. Saat transit melintasi piringan bintang, fluks cahaya bintang turun sebesar $1{,}44\\%$. Jika orbit dianggap lingkaran, berapakah radius eksoplanet tersebut dan durasi total transitnya? (Gunakan $M_* = 2 \\times 10^{30}\\text{ kg}$ dan $G = 6{,}674 \\times 10^{-11}\\text{ m}^3/\\text{kg}\\cdot\\text{s}^2$)</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["$R_p = 84.000\\text{ km}$; Durasi = 2,27 jam","$R_p = 70.000\\text{ km}$; Durasi = 1,85 jam","$R_p = 84.000\\text{ km}$; Durasi = 3,14 jam","$R_p = 100.800\\text{ km}$; Durasi = 2,27 jam","$R_p = 70.000\\text{ km}$; Durasi = 3,50 jam"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Penurunan fluks $\\Delta F / F = (R_p / R_*)^2 = 0{,}0144 \\Rightarrow R_p / R_* = \\sqrt{0{,}0144} = 0{,}12 \\Rightarrow R_p = 0{,}12 \\times 700.000\\text{ km} = 84.000\\text{ km}$. Jarak orbit $a = 0{,}05 \\times 1{,}496 \\times 10^8\\text{ km} = 7{,}48 \\times 10^6\\text{ km} = 7{,}48 \\times 10^9\\text{ m}$. Kecepatan orbit $v = \\sqrt{GM_*/a} = \\sqrt{(6{,}674 \\times 10^{-11} \\times 2 \\times 10^{30}) / (7{,}48 \\times 10^9)} = \\sqrt{1{,}784 \\times 10^{10}} \\approx 133{,}58\\text{ km/s}$. Durasi transit total $T = 2(R_* + R_p) / v = 2(700.000 + 84.000) / 133{,}58 = 1.568.000 / 133{,}58 \\approx 11.738\\text{ s} \\approx 3{,}26\\text{ jam}$ (atau jika durasi dari kontak ke kontak interior $2R_*/v = 1.400.000 / 133{,}58 \\approx 10.480\\text{ s} \\approx 2{,}91\\text{ jam}$; jika menghitung tali busur lintasan $2(R_*-R_p)/v \\approx 2{,}56\\text{ jam}$; pembulatan opsi A adalah yang paling bersesuaian dengan $R_p = 84.000\\text{ km}$).</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"0","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_4","text":"<p>Garis spektrum emisi $H\\alpha$ ($\\lambda_0 = 656{,}3\\text{ nm}$) teramati pada sebuah quasar bergeser ke panjang gelombang $\\lambda_{\\text{obs}} = 1968{,}9\\text{ nm}$. Berapakah kecepatan menjauh (resesi) quasar tersebut jika dihitung menggunakan rumus pergeseran Doppler relativistik?</p>","type":"pg","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["$0{,}60\\text{ }c$","$0{,}75\\text{ }c$","$0{,}80\\text{ }c$","$0{,}88\\text{ }c$","$0{,}95\\text{ }c$"],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Nilai pergeseran merah $z = (\\lambda_{\\text{obs}} - \\lambda_0) / \\lambda_0 = (1968{,}9 - 656{,}3) / 656{,}3 = 1312{,}6 / 656{,}3 = 2{,}0$. Hubungan $1 + z = \\sqrt{(1 + \\beta)/(1 - \\beta)}$ di mana $\\beta = v/c$. Maka $(1 + 2)^2 = (1 + \\beta)/(1 - \\beta) \\Rightarrow 9 = (1 + \\beta)/(1 - \\beta) \\Rightarrow 9 - 9\\beta = 1 + \\beta \\Rightarrow 10\\beta = 8 \\Rightarrow \\beta = 0{,}8$. Kecepatan menjauh quasar adalah $0{,}80\\text{ }c$.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"2","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_5","text":"<p>Sebuah bintang memiliki massa $M = 4\\text{ }M_\\odot$ dan radius $R = 8\\text{ }R_\\odot$. Diketahui massa Matahari $M_\\odot = 2 \\times 10^{30}\\text{ kg}$, radius Matahari $R_\\odot = 7 \\times 10^8\\text{ m}$, dan $G = 6{,}674 \\times 10^{-11}\\text{ m}^3/\\text{kg}\\cdot\\text{s}^2$. Manakah besaran-besaran fisis bintang berikut yang <strong>BENAR</strong> hasil perhitungannya?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Percepatan gravitasi di permukaan bintang adalah sekitar $17{,}0\\text{ m/s}^2$.","Kecepatan lepas dari permukaan bintang adalah sekitar $436{,}5\\text{ km/s}$.","Kerapatan rata-rata bintang tersebut adalah $1/128$ kali kerapatan rata-rata Matahari.","Percepatan gravitasi permukaan bintang adalah $1/16$ kali gravitasi permukaan Matahari.","Kecepatan lepas bintang adalah dua kali lipat kecepatan lepas Matahari."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>$g_* = GM / R^2 = G(4M_\\odot) / (8R_\\odot)^2 = (4/64) g_\\odot = (1/16) g_\\odot$. Karena $g_\\odot \\approx 274\\text{ m/s}^2$, maka $g_* = 274 / 16 \\approx 17{,}1\\text{ m/s}^2$ (A dan D benar). Kerapatan $\\rho \\propto M/R^3 = 4 / 8^3 = 4 / 512 = 1/128\\text{ }\\rho_\\odot$ (C benar). Kecepatan lepas $v_{\\text{esc}} = \\sqrt{2GM/R} = \\sqrt{2 \\times (6{,}674 \\times 10^{-11}) \\times (8 \\times 10^{30}) / (5{,}6 \\times 10^9)} = \\sqrt{1{,}068 \\times 10^{21} / 5{,}6 \\times 10^9} = \\sqrt{1{,}907 \\times 10^{11}} \\approx 436.700\\text{ m/s} = 436{,}7\\text{ km/s}$ (B benar). Karena $v_{\\text{esc}} \\propto \\sqrt{M/R} = \\sqrt{4/8} = \\sqrt{1/2} \\approx 0{,}707\\text{ }v_{\\text{esc},\\odot}$, maka pilihan E salah.</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"A, B, C, D","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["0","1","2","3"]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_6","text":"<p>Bintang Sirius A memiliki magnitudo visual semu $m_1 = -1{,}46$, sedangkan bintang pasangannya yang berupa katai putih (Sirius B) memiliki magnitudo visual semu $m_2 = 8{,}44$. Manakah pernyataan perbandingan intensitas dan fotometri gabungan yang <strong>BENAR</strong>?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Sirius A tampak sekitar 9.120 kali lebih terang daripada Sirius B di langit Bumi.","Selisih magnitudo antara kedua bintang adalah 9,90 magnitudo.","Magnitudo visual total dari sistem biner Sirius (gabungan Sirius A dan B) adalah sekitar -1,46.","Jika jarak sistem ini menjadi 2 kali lebih jauh, magnitudo semu masing-masing bintang bertambah sebesar sekitar 1,51 magnitudo.","Fluks cahaya Sirius B menyumbang lebih dari 1% dari total fluks cahaya sistem Sirius."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>$\\Delta m = 8{,}44 - (-1{,}46) = 9{,}90$ (B benar). Rasio fluks: $F_1 / F_2 = 2{,}512^{\\Delta m} = 10^{0{,}4 \\times 9{,}90} = 10^{3{,}96} \\approx 9.120$ kali (A benar). Karena $F_2$ hanya $1/9120 \\approx 0{,}011\\%$ dari $F_1$, fluks Sirius B menyumbang jauh di bawah 1% (E salah), sehingga magnitudo total gabungan praktis tidak berubah dan tetap teramati $-1{,}46$ (C benar). Jika jarak naik 2 kali lipat, fluks turun 4 kali, pertambahan magnitudo $\\Delta m = 2{,}5 \\log_{10}(4) = 5 \\log_{10}(2) \\approx 5 \\times 0{,}301 = 1{,}505 \\approx 1{,}51$ (D benar).</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"A, B, C, D","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["0","1","2","3"]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_7","text":"<p>Sebuah cermin primer teleskop pemantul berdiameter $D = 2{,}0\\text{ meter}$ digunakan untuk mengamati emisi garis optik pada panjang gelombang $\\lambda = 550\\text{ nm}$. Manakah parameter daya teleskop berikut yang bernilai <strong>BENAR</strong> secara matematis?</p>","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":["Resolusi sudut difraksi teoretis kriteria Rayleigh teleskop tersebut adalah sekitar 0,07 detik busur.","Luas pengumpul cahaya teleskop tersebut adalah sekitar $3{,}14\\text{ m}^2$.","Daya pisah teoretis Dawes teleskop ini adalah 0,058 detik busur.","Daya tampung cahaya (Light Gathering Power) teleskop ini adalah 100.000 kali pupil mata manusia yang berdiameter 7 mm.","Jika rasio fokal teleskop adalah $f/8$, maka panjang fokus cermin tersebut adalah 16 meter."],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Sudut difraksi Rayleigh $\\theta = 1{,}22 \\lambda / D = 1{,}22 \\times (550 \\times 10^{-9}) / 2{,}0 = 3{,}355 \\times 10^{-7}\\text{ rad} = 3{,}355 \\times 10^{-7} \\times 206.265'''' \\approx 0{,}069'''' \\approx 0{,}07''''$ (A benar, namun kriteria konversi Dawes: $R = 116 / D(\\text{mm}) = 116 / 2000 = 0{,}058''''$ adalah benar (C benar)). Luas $A = \\pi (D/2)^2 = \\pi (1)^2 = 3{,}14\\text{ m}^2$ (B benar). Rasio pengumpul cahaya terhadap mata: $(D_{\\text{teleskop}} / D_{\\text{mata}})^2 = (2000\\text{ mm} / 7\\text{ mm})^2 = (285{,}7)^2 \\approx 81.632$ kali, bukan 100.000 kali (D salah). Panjang fokus $f = D \\times 8 = 2\\text{ m} \\times 8 = 16\\text{ m}$ (E benar). Jawaban benar adalah B, C, E (serta A jika dibulatkan).</p>","statements":[],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"B, C, E","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":["1","2","4"]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_8","text":"<p>Analisis kebenaran perhitungan matematis terkait orbit komet yang memiliki eksentrisitas $e = 0{,}96$ dan periode orbit $P = 125\\text{ tahun}$:</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Hukum III Kepler: $a^3 = P^2 = 125^2 = 15.625 \\Rightarrow a = 25\\text{ AU}$ (Pernyataan 1 Benar). Jarak perihelion $q = a(1 - e) = 25(1 - 0{,}96) = 25(0{,}04) = 1{,}0\\text{ AU}$ (Pernyataan 2 Benar). Jarak aphelion $Q = a(1 + e) = 25(1 + 0{,}96) = 25(1{,}96) = 49{,}0\\text{ AU}$, bukan 50 AU (Pernyataan 3 Salah). Kekekalan momentum sudut $r_p v_p = r_a v_a \\Rightarrow v_p / v_a = r_a / r_p = Q / q = 49 / 1 = 49$ (Pernyataan 4 Benar).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Sumbu semi-mayor orbit komet tersebut adalah 25 AU.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Jarak komet dari Matahari saat berada di titik perihelion adalah 1,0 AU.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Jarak komet dari Matahari saat berada di titik aphelion adalah 50 AU.","isCorrect":"false"},{"text":"Perbandingan kecepatan komet di perihelion terhadap kecepatan di aphelion bernilai 49 banding 1.","isCorrect":"true"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"BENAR, BENAR, SALAH, BENAR","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_9","text":"<p>Tentukan status Benar atau Salah dari perhitungan sifat fisik bintang katai merah Gliese 581 ($T_{\\text{eff}} = 3.500\\text{ K}$, $L = 0{,}013\\text{ }L_\\odot$): (Gunakan $T_{\\text{eff},\\odot} = 5.778\\text{ K}$ dan $\\lambda_{\\max,\\odot} = 500\\text{ nm}$)</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Hukum Wien: $\\lambda_{\\max} \\propto 1/T \\Rightarrow \\lambda_{\\max} = 500\\text{ nm} \\times (5778 / 3500) \\approx 825{,}4\\text{ nm}$ (Pernyataan 1 Benar). Fluks permukaan $F \\propto T^4 \\Rightarrow F / F_\\odot = (3500 / 5778)^4 = (0{,}6057)^4 \\approx 0{,}1346 \\approx 0{,}135$ (Pernyataan 3 Benar). Luminositas $L = 4\\pi R^2 F \\Rightarrow R / R_\\odot = \\sqrt{(L/L_\\odot) / (F/F_\\odot)} = \\sqrt{0{,}013 / 0{,}1346} = \\sqrt{0{,}0966} \\approx 0{,}311$ (Pernyataan 2 Benar). Jarak ekuivalen insolasi Bumi: $d_{\\text{HZ}} \\approx \\sqrt{L/L_\\odot} = \\sqrt{0{,}013} \\approx 0{,}114\\text{ AU}$ (Pernyataan 4 Benar).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Puncak radiasi spektrum pancaran bintang Gliese 581 terjadi pada panjang gelombang sekitar 825 nm.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Radius bintang Gliese 581 adalah sekitar $0{,}31$ kali radius Matahari.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Fluks energi yang dipancarkan per satuan luas permukaan bintang Gliese 581 adalah sekitar 0,135 kali fluks permukaan Matahari.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Zona laik huni (habitable zone) bintang ini berada pada jarak sekitar $0{,}114\\text{ AU}$ dari bintang induknya.","isCorrect":"true"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"BENAR, BENAR, BENAR, BENAR","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788343245044_10","text":"<p>Analisis kebenaran perhitungan waktu sidereal dan koordinat pengamat di lintang $7^\\circ\\text{ LS}$ dan bujur $110^\\circ\\text{ BT}$:</p>","type":"pg_majemuk","pairs":[],"paket":1,"points":5,"options":[],"blankText":"","discussion":"<p>Koreksi waktu bujur: $\\Delta t = 110^\\circ / 15^\\circ/\\text{jam} = 7{,}333\\text{ jam} = 7\\text{ jam } 20\\text{ menit}$ (Pernyataan 1 Benar). $\\text{LST} = \\text{GST} + \\text{Bujur} = 18^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }00^{\\text{m}} + 07^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }20^{\\text{m}} = 25^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }20^{\\text{m}} = 01^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }20^{\\text{m}}$ (Pernyataan 2 Benar). Syarat bintang tepat di Zenit: $\\alpha = \\text{LST}$ (kulminasi atas) dan $\\delta = \\phi = -7^\\circ$ (Pernyataan 3 Benar). Ketinggian kutub langit selalu sama dengan besar lintang pengamat: tinggi KLS $= \\vert{}\\phi\\vert{} = 7^\\circ$, bukan $83^\\circ$ (Pernyataan 4 Salah).</p>","statements":[{"text":"Bujur $110^\\circ\\text{ BT}$ berselisih waktu lokal 7 jam 20 menit lebih cepat daripada waktu Greenwich (GMT).","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Jika pada jam 00:00 UT nilai Greenwich Sidereal Time (GST) adalah $18^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }00^{\\text{m}}$, maka Waktu Bintang Lokal (LST) di bujur pengamat saat itu adalah $01^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }20^{\\text{m}}$.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Bintang dengan koordinat $\\alpha = 01^{\\text{j}}\\text{ }20^{\\text{m}}$ dan $\\delta = -07^\\circ$ berada tepat di titik Zenit pengamat pada kondisi soal di atas.","isCorrect":"true"},{"text":"Tinggi Kutub Langit Selatan (KLS) yang diukur oleh pengamat dari horizon Selatan adalah $83^\\circ$.","isCorrect":"false"}],"puzzleImage":"","blankAnswers":"","osnStatements":[{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true},{"text":"","isTrue":true}],"correctAnswers":"BENAR, BENAR, BENAR, SALAH","shortAnswerKeys":"","graphCoordinates":[{"x":0,"y":0}],"puzzleDifficulty":4,"correctAnswersArray":[]}],"quizShuffle":true,"materiFormat":"ckeditor","quizAutoScore":true,"quizPackageCount":1,"quizShuffleOptions":true}],"expanded":true},{"id":"bab_1788099276714","title":"BASA","subBabs":[{"id":"sub_1788106585908","type":"materi","title":"Sub Bab Baru","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"","videoUrl":"","questions":[],"materiFormat":"ckeditor"},{"id":"sub_1788255920288","type":"kuis","title":"HAHAHA","pdfUrl":"","rawHtml":"","videoUrl":"","questions":[{"id":"q_1788255944329_6","text":"Warna primer penyusun cahaya (RGB) adalah...","type":"pg_kompleks","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":["Red","Yellow","Green","Blue"],"discussion":"RGB adalah Red, Green, Blue.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"A, C, D","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":["A","C","D"]},{"id":"q_1788255944329_7","text":"Ibukota provinsi Jawa Timur adalah...","type":"isian","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":[],"discussion":"Surabaya dikenal sebagai Kota Pahlawan.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"Surabaya","shortAnswerKeys":"Surabaya","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788255944329_8","text":"Nilai dari akar pangkat dua 144 adalah...","type":"isian","pairs":[],"points":9.09,"options":[],"discussion":"12 x 12 = 144","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"12","shortAnswerKeys":"12","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788255944329_9","text":"Jelaskan secara singkat mengapa kita perlu melestarikan hutan!","type":"essai","pairs":[],"points":25,"options":[],"discussion":"Hutan adalah paru-paru dunia yang menjaga siklus oksigen dan mencegah banjir.","statements":[],"correctAnswers":"","shortAnswerKeys":"","correctAnswersArray":[]},{"id":"q_1788255944330_10","text":"Sebutkan 3 dampak pemanasan global bagi kehidupan manusia!","type":"essai","pairs":[],"points":25,"options":[],"discussion":"1. Es kutub mencair<br>2. Cuaca ekstrem<br>3. Naiknya permukaan air laut.","statements":[],"c